{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "4e67f95804204c0ddd9a45388d5c0ae50808b9fff85e295010e4a8e137ab9d68", "ja": "ミーティング・ハイッ", "zh": "Meeting High", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "323500530741b17d6d50b80b0f7f86f25227c7df00279aaeb5882641cd1d5189", "ja": "次の天体公演のユニット『キャンサー』のメ\nンバーに選ばれた奈緒、ひなた、エミリー。\n疾走感のある新曲に興奮した奈緒は、『真夏\nのリレー走』をやらせてほしいと申し出るの\nだった。", "zh": "奈绪、日向、艾蜜莉被选为\n下一场天体公演团体『巨蟹座』的成员。\n听完充满速度感的歌曲，奈绪感到很兴奋，\n提出了想进行『盛夏大队接力』的要求。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6b6a25ca0f98b3e730e831c022c4adb3a4c1d6ad2c4039f030e769035bed06d5", "ja": "（今日は次の天体公演の初打ち合わせだ。\n元気いっぱいのこの曲、気に入ってくれるといいな！）", "zh": "（今天是下一场天体公演的首次会议。\n希望大家会喜欢这首充满活力的歌曲！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "4c8e49dbde8af43bae27ea50fefe0e98fcb6130977f4a05a2719f579db1a5175", "ja": "いやぁー、みんな聞いてくれる？\n私な、今日遅刻しそうになってん。", "zh": "哎呀～大家愿意听我说吗？\n我啊，今天差点迟到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "6646e96c9e1c14c5fc5491ca02c189aae69e4625ef775b8f7438f0d7226b53f0", "ja": "そうだったんですか？　でも奈緒さんは、\n誰よりも早く、ここにいたような……？", "zh": "是这样吗？不过奈绪，\n我看你好像比所有人都早出现在这里耶……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "5686ff8482afdccb181e28fec4908f4ae360d483eef51ff90c168867b38c2e5e", "ja": "そりゃもう、全力ダッシュしたからな！\n私、スタミナには自信あるほうやねん。", "zh": "那是因为我用了全力冲刺啦！\n我对自己的体力算是有信心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "456b02996684488ed09f8c5094b24e130cd77bf078aba6f1ef74d205bd181894", "ja": "わあ、奈緒さんすごいねぇ。「なせばなる」って、\nばあちゃんが言ってたとおりだべさ。", "zh": "哇～奈绪好厉害喔。\n「有志者事竟成」，跟奶奶说的一样哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "9f3934fc1873a980e2243bc31aae81774e908bfc0cc2451b7287a05640ae727d", "ja": "ひなたのおばあちゃん、ええこと言うなぁ。\nそうそう、なせばなるんや！", "zh": "日向的奶奶说得真好呀。\n没错没错，有志者事竟成！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "ad0a59040b922abed97a1dfb0cea163cfaddf7db7633ea247b220447f87bc1c8", "ja": "為せば成る……私も大好きな日本語です。\nふふ、為せば成る、為せば成る♪", "zh": "有志者事竟成……我也很喜欢这句日本谚语。\n呵呵，有志者事竟成、有志者事竟成♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5ae7346990e6611a77af15b3669ff764c4fb16d5e5fa20d9971f750e20af19f8", "ja": "お、みんなちゃんと揃ってるな。\nお疲れさま！", "zh": "哦，大家都到齐了呢。\n辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "7cb66b7a642604feaf37791ebef5aec14d1d539910500de10f202831f2e7a017", "ja": "お疲れさまです～。", "zh": "辛苦了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "c4179375a4aa74922098c97cd885c493baa5e8893003831c1abdb860b0d59408", "ja": "お疲れさんです。", "zh": "辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "99738abdb75742333660bfe7541e6c845cc1b4ca109f0e6b475b4fad5b1934f8", "ja": "お疲れさまです。", "zh": "辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "87b895a7ab2fd0053413af556250fa2b11a53326ccc938b956d6a07f69145d97", "ja": "なあなあ、{$P$}さん。\n今日の話ってなんなんです？", "zh": "欸欸，{$P$}先生，\n你今天找我们来有什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1a67c42ba952926fd61bc2482f96d885477f8ae81b7ab3a3ec71309552fc9e58", "ja": "口で説明するより、聴いてもらう方が早いだろう。\n今回みんなに集まってもらったのは、このためだ。", "zh": "与其用口头说明，不如直接让大家听比较快。\n今天要大家集合就是为了这个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a6341ecd687f92de8fddb8cb68638cdc320bd8ac435c984133ebcba1defc3db0", "ja": "『ランニング・ハイッ』って曲なんだ。\nどうだ、疾走感がすごいだろ？", "zh": "这首歌叫做『Running High』。\n如何，是不是很有速度感？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "486624b641f959557b98247ad691cd2c541291ede02a9ffccc5aebbfab8a7528", "ja": "はいっ！　なんだか、力が湧いてくるような……\n心が躍る曲ですね♪", "zh": "是的！总觉得涌现了一股力量……\n是首让人心情雀跃不已的歌曲呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "7fe6749f8a2c1eaa13fb88af7bd68a81623796e85116ba5381a33af9bdbb5479", "ja": "ランニングかぁ……\nあたし、長距離を走るのはわりと得意だよぉ。", "zh": "Running啊……\n长跑的话，我还挺拿手的喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e5a5ac49086cea48d603244b82f6fd2b85946cd56f3f8aaa0e80c78f5964fd69", "ja": "みんなにはこの曲をひっさげて天体公演に\n出てほしい。テーマは太陽だ！", "zh": "我希望大家带着这首歌曲参加天体公演，\n主题是太阳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6421a97f09a60e7b008fe0329d59cbad110a128d17a3607138aa552055c27dff", "ja": "そして、そうだな……。\nユニット名は「キャンサー」でどうだろう。", "zh": "然后，我想想……\n团名就叫做『巨蟹座』，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "282a3934a2a7e82c44321e6bf02c4e0ad9fde34f23e773172621fb4329699885", "ja": "ううう～……！", "zh": "呜呜呜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1020_p", "source_sha256": "566cdaf64090bda9f0b828e1a5bdcd8041c50a3567c792eca92f0917c4ad3847", "ja": "ど、どうした奈緒？", "zh": "怎、怎么了，奈绪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1021_037nao", "source_sha256": "217b032471caa27fc59f0380fc33fe4e740470a5efce54e89a147dd6a11833ec", "ja": "ええやん、めっちゃいい曲やん！\n海美やないけど、私も走りたなってきましたー！", "zh": "太棒了，这首歌曲超赞的！\n虽然没有到海美那样，但我也想去跑步啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1022_037nao", "source_sha256": "e56bafe6e2fb3ca6fa997ebf426876444fc8925eee15a980df60f75d52a41722", "ja": "あーもう、我慢できひん！　ちょっと走ってくるわ！\n{$P$}さん、行ってきます！", "zh": "啊～不行，我忍不住了！我去稍微跑一下！\n{$P$}先生，我出发了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1023_p", "source_sha256": "16fc9033819ed80b211f57ee87ae38e10acc2a851707fd9b4bfa28cf14d17d3f", "ja": "あっ、奈緒！？\n……行ってしまった。", "zh": "啊，奈绪！？\n……她跑掉了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1024_032emi", "source_sha256": "edb59942814b44a98ecd202385eda69f55a267823fec75d2c25b0a7eb3dcc576", "ja": "ふふっ。奈緒さんはこの曲が、\nとっても気に入ったみたいですね♪", "zh": "呵呵，奈绪好像很喜欢这首歌呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1025_p", "source_sha256": "feac8c69c35d46ead5b65d572b4e3a8c0e357ad6bc3009524c2e40aa72ad0e01", "ja": "うん……それは嬉しいけど、外は炎天下だからなぁ。\n奈緒、大丈夫かな……？", "zh": "嗯……这我是很高兴，不过外面烈日当空，\n奈绪她没问题吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1026_null", "source_sha256": "f57cfdaa3423982ac99cb2c739d50536ade8181714dd218d7b7e16d5029bb1e3", "ja": "10分後……", "zh": "10分钟后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1027_037nao", "source_sha256": "9f2a64c83d1c9af90301bd8cebb476d8a4bdfc8d58c2d2145b6e769e3b2c2398", "ja": "ぜえ、はあ、ぜえ……。\nうう……水、水を誰か……！", "zh": "呼、呼、呼……\n呜呜……水！谁给我一下水……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1028_035hin", "source_sha256": "37662228598327aa08e53613cca5e587fa71b8c6aaecef4b184e3e767b54240c", "ja": "あっ、奈緒さん、戻ってきたべさ。\n奈緒さん、大丈夫かい？", "zh": "啊！奈绪回来了哪。\n奈绪，你还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1029_037nao", "source_sha256": "57c3b407ba634ccf05255d164eb9fcfb2193dd7aba06a1a330d7ea5946b0aa87", "ja": "ぜえ、はあ……。\nなめてた。真夏の昼間をなめてた……！", "zh": "呼、呼……\n我太小看盛夏的中午了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "3c2b97560557470689040d3ae2951687e8782fd54167a17b43b97dc49ae65605", "ja": "奈緒！　この音無さん特製の麦茶を飲むんだ！", "zh": "奈绪！喝下这杯音无小姐特制的麦茶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1031_037nao", "source_sha256": "f6dbdfe9055a8b88efd2da835fb24c607dac739b1c868bdde07790d70c1ef3c2", "ja": "ゴクゴクゴク……ぷはぁ！！　うわ、この麦茶、\nめっちゃおいしい！　生き返りましたぁ！", "zh": "咕噜咕噜咕噜……噗哈！！\n天啊，这杯麦茶超好喝的！我复活啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1032_037nao", "source_sha256": "8d257bde0181534af13510f0a69feb61bced49f7f5e1faaa0c4c82dda06a365a", "ja": "せやけど私、スタミナにはほんま自信あったんです！\nなんや、悔しいわぁ……。", "zh": "但是，我对体力真的很有自信的说！\n总觉得好不甘心呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1033_p", "source_sha256": "7c00e309230c2eac6f88f4a5d9c573fa2c913a0c3c38d40faec51bbfac4377e0", "ja": "この炎天下にいきなり走り出したら誰でもそうなるよ。\n準備万端の状態で走れば、大丈夫なはずだから。", "zh": "在烈日当空下突然出去跑步，不论是谁都会累坏的。\n如果做好万全准备再跑，应该就没问题了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1034_037nao", "source_sha256": "b3dc168d772c532ac9dbd318c95bf25c734d2e018aa0810001dc614ddb126275", "ja": "何事も準備が大事なんやな……。\nよっしゃ、次はバッチリ準備して挑むで！", "zh": "凡事都要做好准备呢……\n好，下次我会准备万全再去挑战的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1035_p", "source_sha256": "aa564d1c006b53904e2fcd6db468f5ba49fe965456b9d221e768c62b1b54bb92", "ja": "ちょっと話が脱線したけど……それで、だ。みんなに\nさっきの曲を歌ってもらいたいんだけど、どうかな？", "zh": "有点离题了……所以就是，\n我想请大家演唱刚才那首歌曲，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1036_032emi", "source_sha256": "37d2b9f1f929bdf49fb0bafe407b381bece05407120130aeccf069544a21cdb5", "ja": "はい、もちろんやらせていただきたいです！\n太陽の下でも、大和撫子らしくがんばります♪", "zh": "当然没问题，我很想演唱！\n即使在太阳下，我也会像个大和抚子一样努力的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1037_035hin", "source_sha256": "69a8452f1d477cbae30dabd9797acbb58517045be92b041221068fe7f19a3e13", "ja": "ランニングしながら歌ったら、なまら楽しそうだねぇ。\nあたしも、やってみたいべさ！", "zh": "一边跑步一边唱歌，感觉特开心呢。\n我也想试试看哪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1038_p", "source_sha256": "1b08f49b44d1010c394d39df63a295d14969332edbf8c4fdf929bba28ddd8120", "ja": "エミリーとひなたはやってくれるか。\n奈緒は……ん、奈緒？", "zh": "艾蜜莉跟日向都愿意是吧，\n那奈绪……嗯，奈绪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1039_037nao", "source_sha256": "c548a837c76535e00ae055f8db63394dd12fc409ae1d400e065580672f2d7032", "ja": "太陽の下……ランニング……。", "zh": "太阳下……跑步……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1040_037nao", "source_sha256": "656e5e08e1e5a8d266fdd15244eafe1376616d7c701f0c3b2e92d61f0cdfea57", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　私、決めました。\nこの曲、絶対にやりきってみせます！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n我决定了，我一定会唱好这首歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1041_p", "source_sha256": "016f056c7d398cb94b36edc34b239f62cf520d1e276bc2e2ccdadbcbd8c09a92", "ja": "おお……すごい熱意だな。", "zh": "哦哦……你很有热忱呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1042_037nao", "source_sha256": "97a00b61a4fa3d8b966b29bab567acdac3ec5b8f25db59eb3acfa6c9e3ad7e9b", "ja": "はい！　私、今めっちゃ燃えてますから！\n真夏の太陽みたいに！", "zh": "是的！我现在斗志都燃烧起来了！\n就跟盛夏的太阳一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1043_032emi", "source_sha256": "830cc8b437656555eb6e9bb224d6949386c394c2ae9b25adcb2924c662392d54", "ja": "奈緒さんの情熱、\nまるで炎のような迫力です！", "zh": "奈绪的热情，\n宛如火焰般充满魄力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1044_035hin", "source_sha256": "2c52e488d91e7d500c5a7d37b0b22322a26448c76a459be807731299aa8f662d", "ja": "すごいやる気だねぇ。\n見てるだけでヤケドしそうなくらいだよぉ。", "zh": "真的干劲十足呢。\n光是在一旁看着感觉就快被烫伤了哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1045_p", "source_sha256": "aeebc41f4069d4ab31479e6459dbc59c3839ca2631809b27f5ac5abb8f3f61b7", "ja": "奈緒……そんなに熱くなってくれるなんて、嬉しいよ！\n頑張って公演を成功させような！", "zh": "奈绪……你竟然这么有热情，我好高兴！\n我们要努力让公演成功！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1046_037nao", "source_sha256": "75baeee2a799ff47769fae13f62643e1b8050d368334654cb8b6cced2721c247", "ja": "はい、毎日走り込みします！\n公演に向けてのレッスンも、欠かしません！", "zh": "是的，我会每天去跑步！\n也会确实做好公演的训练！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_01_1047_037nao", "source_sha256": "fc8d3f8bf30275a4bb69c113d7bda4a1f651671b58181eab141787bee88f3d36", "ja": "せやから、私らにやらせてほしいんです！\n劇場を走り抜ける、真夏のリレー走を！", "zh": "所以，希望你能同意！\n让我们进行绕着剧场跑一圈的盛夏大队接力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
